h-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\in\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\in\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a> 的明确语言与句子集编码。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Model}\">\\(\\mathrm{Model}\\)</span> 分别为依赖文件中的传递集谓词与二元模型谓词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_\\in\">\\(\\mathfrak M_\\in\\)</span> 为下式给出的成员结构编码函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner2TransitiveModel}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner2TransitiveModel}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> 保留原调用接口。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}membership\\text{-}structure\\text{-}code}\\vdash\n\\mathfrak M_\\in(M)\\coloneqq\\langle M,\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in M\\times M:x\\in y\\}\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}membership\\text{-}structure\\text{-}code}\\vdash\n\\mathfrak M_\\in(M)\\coloneqq\\langle M,\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in M\\times M:x\\in y\\}\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner2\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner2TransitiveModel}_S(M)\\leftrightarrow\nM\\ne\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(M)\\land\n\\mathrm{Model}(\\mathfrak M_\\in(M),\\mathrm{ZFC}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner2\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner2TransitiveModel}_S(M)\\leftrightarrow\nM\\ne\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(M)\\land\n\\math